.TH xyrev 1  "xyrev 0.4.0" 
.SH NAME
xyrev \- Developer environment and Git\-backed dotfile management
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxyrev\fR [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Developer environment and Git\-backed dotfile management
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Show more debugging information
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
xyrev\-init(1)
Create a new configuration folder or reinitialize the existing one
.TP
xyrev\-agent(1)
.TP
xyrev\-apple(1)
.TP
xyrev\-dotfile(1)
Manage dotfiles from a Git repository using chezmoi\-style names
.TP
xyrev\-completions(1)
Generate shell completions from the current command definitions
.TP
xyrev\-man(1)
Render the manual, or write all command manuals to a directory
.TP
xyrev\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.4.0
